Similarly for DA we need mark_destination_availability_dispatch_ready after we have loaded/unloaded DA and transport leg conditions.

Thus we need to assemble transport leg and authorize loading before we can mark both OA and DA dispatch_ready.

But note that mark_origin_availability_dispatch_ready and mark_destination_availability_dispatch_ready both require transport_leg_assembled and transport_leg_loading_authorized. So we need to achieve those before marking either.

Thus we need to assemble transport leg and authorize loading.

Now we also need to allocate dispatch slots to OA and DA, and make them dispatch_ready (via mark actions) and then dispatch OA (execute_origin_dispatch) to get dispatched OA true and free VUA.

