- After both prepared, we have OA and DA locked/confirmed, nodes ready/occupied, cargo available.
- Assemble transport leg (requires OA locked, DA locked, nodes ready, origins/destinations confirmed, transport leg available). We have transport_leg_available true initially.
- Authorize transport leg loading (requires OA locked, OA task profile linked, transport leg assembled).
- Mark OA dispatch_ready (requires OA locked, OA confirmed, transport leg assembled, transport leg loading authorized).
- Mark DA dispatch_ready (similar).
- Allocate dispatch slot to OA (requires OA dispatch_ready, task profile linked? Wait allocate_dispatch_slot_for_candidate precondition: dispatch_ready ?candidate, candidate_task_profile_linked ?candidate ?route_task_profile, dispatch_slot_available ?dispatch_slot, not dispatch_allocated ?candidate. So we need OA task profile linked (we have), dispatch_slot_available (we will have after dispatching SCA earlier), not dispatch_allocated OA (currently false). So we can allocate.
- Execute origin dispatch (execute_origin_dispatch) -> dispatched OA true, vehicle_available VUA, dispatch_slot_available DS true (again).
- Allocate dispatch slot to DA (requires DA dispatch_ready, DA task profile linked, dispatch_slot_available true (we just made it available after origin dispatch), not dispatch_allocated DA false). After allocation, dispatch_slot_available becomes false.
- Goal does not require dispatch_slot_available true; fine.
- Additionally we need to dispatch shift_candidate_alpha (we already did earlier).
- Need to have candidate_vehicle_linked shift_candidate_beta vehicle_unit_gamma true: we will allocate VUG to SCB after dispatching SCA (which freed VUG).
- Need vehicle_allocated shift_candidate_beta true (will be true after allocation).
- Need cargo_available cargo_payload_alpha true (goal). After unloads we will have cargo_available true (both origin and destination unloads release cargo). Actually we will load origin payload (cargo false), then unload origin (cargo true). Then load destination payload (cargo false), then unload destination (cargo true). So final cargo_available true.
- Need compliance_certificate_available compliance_certificate_alpha true (we released earlier).
- Need origin_node_occupied true, origin_node_ready true (we have after unload origin).
- Need destination_node_occupied true, destination_node_ready true (after unload destination).
- Need transport_leg_assembled true, transport_leg_origin_linked transport_leg_alpha origin_node_alpha true, transport_leg_destination_linked transport_leg_alpha destination_node_alpha true, transport_leg_loading_authorized true (we will have after authorize).
- Need vehicle_allocated destination_availability_alpha true (we will allocate VUB to DA).
