- Need dispatched shift_candidate_alpha true (after schedule dispatch).
- Need vehicle_available vehicle_unit_alpha true (after origin dispatch).
- Need cargo_available cargo_payload_alpha true (after unloads).
- Need compliance_certificate_available compliance_certificate_alpha true (after release).
- Need origin_node_occupied true, origin_node_ready true (after unload origin).
- Need destination_node_occupied true, destination_node_ready true (after unload destination).
- Need transport_leg_assembled true, transport_leg_origin_linked transport_leg_alpha origin_node_alpha true, transport_leg_destination_linked transport_leg_alpha destination_node_alpha true, transport_leg_loading_authorized true (after authorize).
- Need vehicle_allocated destination_availability_alpha true (after allocation).
- Need vehicle_allocated shift_candidate_beta true (after allocation).
- Need vehicle_allocated shift_candidate_alpha? Not required but still true.
